  "releaseNotes": "- BREAKING: Removed global cancellation from core GDTask (including GDTask.CancelAllTasks and related global token pipeline).\n      - Added GDTask.WhenEach and related async-enumeration support.\n      - Added generic TState overloads for RunOnThreadPool to reduce boxing/casting overhead.\n      - Removed internal GodotEqualityComparer and switched affected paths to standard comparer behavior.\n      - Standardized .NET 9+ synchronization paths on System.Threading.Lock.\n      - Updated README documentation for GDTask.WhenEach.\n      - Note: intermediate global-cancellation PRs in this cycle were superseded by the final removal in PR #33.",
